<view class="page result-page" wx:if="{{result}}">
  <view class="eyebrow">个人现金流 DCF 实验室</view>
  <!-- 1. 顶部 Hero 卡片：总现值估算 (Big Number) + 极简人设金句 -->
  <view class="hero-overview-card">
    <view class="hero-val-section" wx:if="{{hasMoney}}">
      <view class="hero-caption">个人现金流系统估算现值</view>
      <view class="hero-amount">{{result.displayDcf.totalPv}}</view>
      <view class="hero-note">按今天购买力折现 (折现率 3.5%) · 覆盖工作至退休后</view>
    </view>
    <view class="hero-val-section undisclosed" wx:else>
      <view class="hero-caption">个人现金流系统结构分布</view>
      <view class="hero-amount-undisclosed">金额未公开</view>
      <view class="hero-note">基于三段式现金流结构推演相对占比</view>
    </view>

    <!-- 极简人设金句区 -->
    <view class="hero-persona-divider"></view>
    <view class="hero-persona-row">
      <view class="hero-persona-badge">{{result.persona.badge}}</view>
      <view class="hero-persona-punchline">{{result.persona.punchline}}</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 2. 现金流三段式结构堆叠图 -->
  <view class="structure-card">
    <view class="card-caption">个人现金流三段式结构</view>
    <view class="stacked-bar">
      <view class="bar-seg working" style="width: {{result.dcf.ratios.workingRatio}}%"></view>
      <view class="bar-seg pension" style="width: {{result.dcf.ratios.postRetirementRatio}}%"></view>
      <view class="bar-seg tv" style="width: {{result.dcf.ratios.strictTvRatio}}%"></view>
    </view>

    <view class="breakdown-list">
      <view class="breakdown-item">
        <view class="item-left">
          <view class="dot working-dot"></view>
          <text class="item-name">工作期现金流现值</text>
        </view>
        <view class="item-right">
          <text class="item-ratio">{{result.dcf.ratios.workingRatio}}%</text>
          <text wx:if="{{hasMoney}}" class="item-amount">{{result.displayDcf.workingPv}}</text>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="breakdown-item">
        <view class="item-left">
          <view class="dot pension-dot"></view>
          <text class="item-name">退休后有限期现金流</text>
        </view>
        <view class="item-right">
          <text class="item-ratio">{{result.dcf.ratios.postRetirementRatio}}%</text>
          <text wx:if="{{hasMoney}}" class="item-amount">约 {{result.displayDcf.postRetirePv}}</text>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="breakdown-item">
        <view class="item-left">
          <view class="dot tv-dot"></view>
          <text class="item-name">严格终值现值 (TV)</text>
        </view>
        <view class="item-right">
          <text class="item-ratio">{{result.dcf.ratios.strictTvRatio}}%</text>
          <text wx:if="{{hasMoney}}" class="item-amount">{{result.displayDcf.strictTvPv === '0' ? '无' : result.displayDcf.strictTvPv}}</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 3. 收入断崖特别预警（中断风险时触发） -->
  <view wx:if="{{hasCliff}}" class="cliff-alert">
    <view class="alert-header">
      <text class="alert-icon">⚠️</text>
      <text class="alert-title">职业收入断崖预警</text>
    </view>
    <view class="alert-content">
      在“中断风险”设定下，劳动现金流仅计入未来 5 年（至 {{result.currentAge + 5}} 岁）。
      距离法定退休年龄（{{result.statutoryRetirementAge}} 岁）有长达 <text class="bold">{{result.dcf.cliff.cliffYears}} 年</text> 的劳动收入真空期。
    </view>
    <view class="alert-foot">
      这导致工作期现值大幅缩水，凸显出提前建立现金安全垫与独立收入系统的必要性。
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 4. 底部操作按钮 -->
  <button class="primary-button" bindtap="openShare">生成不含金额的分享卡</button>
  <button class="secondary-button" bindtap="openActions">查看 3 项系统优化对策</button>

  <view class="links">
    <text bindtap="edit">修改测算假设</text>
    <text bindtap="explain">它是怎么算的？</text>
  </view>

  <!-- 方案 A：轻量级反向 DCF 进阶入口微卡片（居中优雅版） -->
  <view class="reverse-teaser-card" bindtap="openWorkbenchWithReverse">
    <view class="teaser-center-body">
      <view class="teaser-title-row">
        <text class="teaser-icon">🎯</text>
        <text class="teaser-title">设定更高目标？试试反向 DCF</text>
      </view>
      <text class="teaser-subtitle">测算实现目标所需的每月结余或造血副业</text>
    </view>
    <text class="teaser-side-arrow">›</text>
  </view>

  <view class="notice result-notice">{{result.disclosures[0]}}</view>

  <!-- 方法论与深度阅读弹窗 -->
  <view wx:if="{{showRulesModal}}" class="modal-mask" bindtap="closeRulesModal">
    <view class="rules-modal-box" catchtap="noop">
      <view class="rules-modal-title">关于个人现金流 DCF 实验室</view>
      <view class="rules-modal-body">
        <view class="rules-lead">我们将企业估值的 DCF 框架迁移至个人：</view>
        <view class="rules-item"><text class="num">1.</text><text>劳动收入是显性有限期现金流，随退休截止；</text></view>
        <view class="rules-item"><text class="num">2.</text><text>养老金属于退休后有限期年金现值，不计入永续终值；</text></view>
        <view class="rules-item"><text class="num">3.</text><text>严格终值仅在具备独立持续造血引擎时准入；</text></view>
        <view class="rules-item"><text class="num">4.</text><text>恪守防双重计价与保守折现纪律，绝不衡量人的身价。</text></view>

        <view class="rules-divider"></view>

        <view class="articles-lead">方法论深度阅读（点击复制链接）：</view>
        <view class="article-link-row" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/15KzTxn6wrm_9NtMJuCVUw" data-name="自由现金流篇" bindtap="copyArticleUrl">
          <text class="article-link-title">• 自由现金流篇：显性工作期的有限性</text>
          <text class="article-link-icon">↗</text>
        </view>
        <view class="article-link-row" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/UZwv6d-8gO9U2cSyxvgtVA" data-name="独立终值篇" bindtap="copyArticleUrl">
          <text class="article-link-title">• 独立终值篇：造血引擎与再投资纪律</text>
          <text class="article-link-icon">↗</text>
        </view>
        <view class="article-link-row" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/o0zvzNG_zCTFffnTi9E1lA" data-name="目标倒推篇" bindtap="copyArticleUrl">
          <text class="article-link-title">• 目标倒推篇：反向估值与现实检验</text>
          <text class="article-link-icon">↗</text>
        </view>
      </view>
      <button class="rules-close-btn" bindtap="closeRulesModal">我明白了</button>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
